# Showcase: every part running on the factory sound (big beat: sends, tape delay, the master
# compressor with PUMP), and a filter sweep, played from the panel at 128 BPM. Audio: build/scenarios/showcase/showcase.wav
wait 300
# ---- 909: four on the floor, clap on 2 and 4, closed hats on the off-beats, open hat, accents
tapkey b0
tapkey w0
tapkey w4
tapkey w8
tapkey w12
tapkey b6
tapkey w4
tapkey w12
tapkey b7
tapkey w2
tapkey w6
tapkey w10
tapkey w14
tapkey w15
tapkey b8
tapkey w7
press ENV
tapkey w0
tapkey w8
release ENV
# ---- 808: cowbell, rim
turn ALGO 1
tapkey b7
tapkey w3
tapkey w10
tapkey b5
tapkey w6
tapkey w13
# ---- 303 A: a TB-3PO line; filter, envelope, drive, delay send
turn ALGO 1
tap ARP
tap OCT+
# ---- 303 B: a second, sparser line
turn ALGO 1
tap ARP
turn K1 -20
tap OCT+
tap EDIT
# ---- BREAK: on every step, a little more complexity and roll, some reverb
turn ALGO 1
tapkey w0
tapkey w1
tapkey w2
tapkey w3
tapkey w4
tapkey w5
tapkey w6
tapkey w7
tapkey w8
tapkey w9
tapkey w10
tapkey w11
tapkey w12
tapkey w13
tapkey w14
tapkey w15
turn K1 15
turn K3 10
# ---- the sound is the factory mix (big beat: the master squeezing and pumping, tape delay on the
# ---- 303s, the clap in the room); only the master filter is switched on (LP) for the sweep
tap LFO
tap LFO
tap LFO
tap LFO
turn K1 1
# ---- tempo 128
press HOME
turn SELECT 3
release HOME
expect tempo 128
# ---- play 16 bars: 4 as is, a filter sweep down and up, a breakdown, everything back
wav showcase.wav
tap PLAY
wait 3000
tap HOME
wait 300
shot s01_home.png
wait 4200
# MIX remembers its page (FILTER): one tap
tap LFO
shot s02_mix_comp.png
expect sound6.0.1 4
turn K2 -55
shot s03_filter_sweep.png
turn K2 55
tap HOME
tapkey b2
tapkey b4
tapkey b0
wait 3700
shot s04_breakdown.png
tapkey b0
tapkey b2
tapkey b4
wait 2000
turn ALGO -4
wait 800
shot s05_909.png
turn ALGO 2
wait 800
shot s06_303a.png
turn ALGO 2
wait 800
shot s07_break.png
tap FX
wait 300
shot s08_fx.png
tap LFO
wait 400
shot s09_mix.png
wait 3000
tap PLAY
wait 2500
wavstop
expect sound6.0.1 4
expect peak_db_min -24
